edit(30,'ears','WHEN a supported shell action becomes disabled, the shell SHALL retain its declared position, expose disabled state and any reason required by the frozen per-surface policy, and follow that navigation policy without dispatching it through pointer, keyboard or accessibility activation.','Disabled reasons follow the frozen product policy rather than a new universal requirement.')
